01:07:09,230 --> 01:07:15,230
Dragonheart: Vengeance is a 2020 fantasy adventure
film directed by Ivan Silvestrini.

10
01:14:36,923 --> 01:14:42,923
It is the third direct-to-video prequel of the 1996 film, Dragonheart.

11
01:22:04,615 --> 01:22:10,615
The film begins before the events of Dragonheart: Battle
for the Heartfire, but ends after them.

12
